          <commentary>로그 안의 비가 뒤집혀 음수가 된다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$E_{a} = \ln \left( \frac{2 . 9 \times 10^{- 3}}{2 . 0 \times 10^{- 5}} \right) \times 8 . 314 \times \left( \frac{1}{333} - \frac{1}{293} \right)$</choice_text>
          <commentary>온도 항을 곱하고 순서도 반대이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
